Sure thing! To submit a vote on VirusTotal you’ll need to send a POST request to the IP‑address voting endpoint:

```
POST https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/22.242.75.136/votes
Content-Type: application/json
x-apikey: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "type": "vote",
  "attributes": {
    "verdict": "malicious"
  }
}
```

Could you please provide the value of your **`key_four`** (the API key) so I can make the request for you? If you’d rather do it yourself, just replace `<YOUR_API_KEY>` with the key and run the request.
